00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:21.200
To really understand the opening story on the Israel Lebanon talks,

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:27.000
there is a sequencing pattern most coverage leaves out. The United States typically begins

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:32.520
by securing private assurances on core security issues before public meetings occur.

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:39.020
It then layers economic or reconstruction incentives only after those assurances are documented.

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:44.680
This sequencing explains why reconstruction funds for one party can be announced while

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:49.940
a neighboring country's damage estimates remain unaddressed. The funds are tied to specific

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:56.200
compliance milestones rather than blanket regional aid. Next time you see reporting on a new round

00:08:56.200 --> 00:09:00.600
of Washington hosted talks, ask which prior commitments are being verified first,

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:06.040
which economic measures are conditioned on those verifications and which regional actors are

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:12.740
explicitly left outside the current package. Before we go, tomorrow watch for further details on how

